    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TriggerLand</strong> is a chaotic third-person shooter that throws political correctness out the window and dives headfirst into parody mayhem. Step into a world where overblown stereotypes are your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through wave-based arenas filled with rednecks, conspiracy nuts, HOA, boomers, Karens, and more\u2014all brought to life with exaggerated voice lines. Every round gets harder, dumber, and funnier</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819250/extras/eaa033a2323e8fd97dc2c41c6c1ef83e.avif?t=1755750243\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
