        "notes": "This game contains content that may not be appropriate for all ages. It includes:\r\n\r\nCartoon Violence: Players engage in exaggerated, over-the-top combat using a variety of weapons. Blood effects and slapstick-style injury animations are present, but not realistic.\r\n\r\nSatirical Themes: The game includes caricatures of real-world groups and exaggerated stereotypes, presented for comedic effect. Some players may find certain jokes or character portrayals offensive or socially sensitive.\r\n\r\nMild Sexual or Suggestive Content: Some characters or dialogue may contain suggestive innuendo, but there is no nudity or depiction of sexual acts.\r\n\r\nDrug and Alcohol References: Certain gameplay elements include fictional drug items or comical intoxication effects, used for humorous or gameplay purposes."
